        "question_text": "Q.60 \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nConsider the following ANSI-C program. \n#include <stdio.h> \nint main(){ \n  int *ptr, a, b, c; \n  a=5; b=11; c=20; \n  ptr=&a; *ptr=c; ptr=&c; \n  a=*(&b); c=*ptr-a; \n  printf(\"%d\",c); \n  return(0); \n} \nThe output of this program is ____________. (answer in integer) \nNote: Assume that the program compiles and runs successfully.",
