        "question_type": "MCQ",
        "question_text": "Q.1 If \u2018\u2192\u2019 denotes increasing order of intensity, then the meaning of the words [walk \u2192 jog \u2192 sprint] is analogous to [bothered \u2192 ________ \u2192 daunted]. Which one of the given options is appropriate to fill the blank? (A) phased (B) phrased (C) fazed (D) fused",
        "ai_subject": "Databases",
        "ai_topic": "ER Model",
